2">dasu</span> <span begin="3:40.312" end="3:40.992">chikara</span> <span begin="3:40.992" end="3:41.442">ga</span> <span begin="3:42.022" end="3:42.402">boku</span> <span begin="3:42.402" end="3:42.622">o</span> <span begin="3:42.622" end="3:42.732">mi</span><span begin="3:42.732" end="3:42.952">ta</span><span begin="3:42.952" end="3:43.162">su</span> <span begin="3:43.162" end="3:43.392">ka</span><span begin="3:43.392" end="3:43.762">ra</span></text><text for="L45"><span begin="3:44.369" end="3:44.789">mou</span> <span begin="3:44.789" end="3:45.159">ichi</span><span begin="3:45.159" end="3:45.469">do</span> <span begin="3:45.739" end="3:46.389">hashi</span><span begin="3:46.389" end="3:46.649">ri</span><span begin="3:46.649" end="3:46.869">da</span><span begin="3:46.869" end="3:47.219">su</span> <span begin="3:47.219" end="3:47.499">su</span><span begin="3:47.499" end="3:48.079">taa</span><span begin="3:48.079" end="3:48.739">to</span></text><text for="L46"><span begin="3:49.085" end="3:49.375">Oh,</span> <span begin="3:49.375" end="3:49.982">no,</span> <span begin="3:49.982" end="3:50.455">no,</span> <span begin="3:50.455" end="3:50.922">yeah</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>Taichi Mukai</songwriter><songwriter>CELSIOR COUPE</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">只要迈步奔跑 你看 便能紧握</text><text for="L2">曾一度放手的明日车票</text><text for="L3">一切都将从这里启程</text><text for="L4">为了亲手寻回 再度归零重启</text><text for="L5">走出检票口 落日余晖映入眼帘</text><text for="L6">橘红暮色在眼前渐渐晕开</text><text for="L7">静静映照着悄然滑落的泪光</text><text for="L8">仿佛在轻声诉说 这里便是归处</text><text for="L9">越是与人并肩同行</text><text for="L10">就越是总在暗自比较</text><text for="L11">不知不觉间踮起脚尖</text><text for="L12">才发觉自己一直在故作坚强</text><text for="L13">只要迈步奔跑 你看 便能紧握</text><text for="L14">曾一度放手的明日车票</text><text for="L15">一切都将从这里启程</text><text for="L16">为了亲手寻回 再度归零重启</text><text for="L17">被过往束缚 拖曳着沉重枷锁</text><text for="L18">到头来已然寸步难行</text><text for="L19">曾想着不如就此消失 忘却一切</text><text for="L20">其实不过是扮作受害者一味逃避罢了</text><text for="L21">比往常微凉的浴水</text><text for="L22">静浸其中 默默自问自答</text><text for="L23">曾让我百般烦恼的种种</text><text for="L24">原来不过是微不足道的小事</text><text for="L25">每当快要灰心受挫时</text><text for="L26">不妨停下脚步 重新审视自己</text><text for="L27">向着真实的自我</text><text for="L28">紧握那颗永不言弃的心</text><text for="L29">一切从头再来 再度归零重启</text><text for="L30">曾将万千琐事过度放大</text><text for="L31">失去了温柔之心 伤及他人</text><text for="L32">渐渐只懂得最偏爱自己</text><text for="L33">回过神来 如今已是孤身一人</text><text for="L34">愿从明日开始</text><text for="L35">能彼此相视而笑</text><text for="L36">就先从这里起</text><text for="L37">一切都能改变</text><text for="L38">只要迈步奔跑 你看 便能紧握</text><text for="L39">曾一度放手的明日车票</text><text for="L40">一切都将从这里启程</text><text for="L41">为了亲手寻回 再度归零重启</text><text for="L42">眼前铺展的世界独属于我</text><text for="L43">再一次亲手寻回 归零重启</text><text for="L44">只因创造的力量正将我充盈</text><text for="L45">再一次迈步奔跑 重新出发</text><text for="L46">Oh, no, no, yeah</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:50.922"><div begin="0:08.233" end="3:50.922"><p begin="0:08.233" end="0:13.853" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.233" end="0:08.873">走</span><span begin="0:08.873" end="0:09.123">り</span><span begin="0:09.123" end="0:09.393">出</span><span begin="0:09.393" end="0:09.713">せ</span><span begin="0:09.713" end="0:10.313">れ</span><span begin="0:10.313" end="0:10.653">ば、</span><span begin="0:10.653" end="0:10.903">ほ</span><span begin="0:10.903" end="0:11.333">ら、</span><span begin="0:11.533" end="0:12.063">掴</span><span begin="0:12.063" end="0:12.763">め</span><span begin="0:12.763" end="0:13.033">る</span><span begin="0:13.033" end="0:13.333">か</span><span begin="0:13.333" end="0:13.853">ら</span></p><p begin="0:14.280" end="0:18.733" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.280" end="0:14.823">一度</span><span begin="0:14.823" end="0:15.343">離</span><span begin="0:15.343" end="0:15.723">し</span><span begin="0:15.7